## Documentation discipline

Every code change in the same diff updates: STATE.md, CHANGELOG.md (append), and CLIENT_DOCS.md if client-visible. PROJECT_MAP.md on structural changes. Never edit past CHANGELOG entries. After ANY user correction: append a lesson to LESSONS.md (pattern + root cause + preventive rule) BEFORE continuing. See PROJECT_RULES.md §3.1.

